    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i built is just... gone. it’s not even sad anymore, it’s just math. you look at the trajectory of my last three years and it’s just a slide toward zero. i feel like i’m subject to this law of entropy where everything i touch just decays faster than it can grow. it feels like it was always going to end like this, honestly. like the math was already decided before i even started.",
